A198new    .23999839    .31545096    .44455065

. 
. // Short-stack weights for D
. nnls2 `D_var' D_hat_ols D_hat_lasso D_hat_rf
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
       sd_EE | Coefficient
-------------+----------------------------------------------------------------
   D_hat_ols |   4.47e-18
